  "goodToKnow": "Aufwarten mit means to come up with or offer something, often impressive or surprising: mit einer Sensation, Neuheiten, einem Rekord aufwarten. It's typical of journalism and marketing. Its older meaning was to wait on or serve guests, as servants did. It's unrelated to waiting in the usual sense. Separable: wartete auf, aufgewartet."
